        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Bel'Veth slams her tail to the ground, damaging, knocking up, and slowing her enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Bel'Veth slams her tail, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/140/200/260/320 + (150% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> foes for 0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9/1 seconds, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 30% for 2 seconds. If a champion is hit, this refreshes the Cooldown of <span>Void Surge</span> in that direction.",
